		{
			dependencies: ["97BD384979DD1A3E"]
			description: [
				"Lay track between the homestead and the outpost and install a station at each end. The route may be modest, but it must be permanent and readable."
				"The first railway is required because later wireless systems should connect a territory you already built, not replace the act of building one."
			]
